            "review_text": "1926yanks\nSeattle, Washington753 contributions\n0\nGreat Restaurant\nJul 2024 • Solo\nI had eaten in the District 1 Hoa Túc & didn’t realize this District 3 one is the same ownership, same menu. It’s not as trendy or crowded -upstairs. Almost empty on. Friday night, while the other one was crowded on a weeknight. \nBut just as good. I started with fried crab & shrimp rolls and then grilled chicken pieces in a lime, ginger (spicy) sauce. \nTerrific meal.\nRead more\nWritten July 6, 2024",
